WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
How could I be so young?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,260
This kid's life is bad

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,260
I had a car accident two years ago

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,260
Can't stand up anymore

5
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,260
The whole person became decadent

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,260
Before

7
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,260
He is just like you

8
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,960
Will make me happy

9
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,960
Sorry grandma

10
