19
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:35,890
you met him

20
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,920
Just don't argue with him

21
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,920
How could it be, grandma?

22
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,920
you helped me so much

23
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:41,920
I will definitely do it then

24
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:42,920
Just like making you happy

25
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,920
Trying to find a way to make Brother Jiang happy
